WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.176
Memories are fragile.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.678
I want us to sketch out the right man.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:14.473
We just need enough details
for someone who knows him.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.851
It won't work. No one knows him.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.355
Found her this morning.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:25.359
The city workers found a body
from a young woman called Julia.

00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:30.239
Six years ago, I was cut up like her.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:32.366
What someone did to Julia,

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.742
they tried to do to you.

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:38.747
If you're trying to be a reporter,
then this is your story.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.335
After what he did...

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:45.963
things weren't how they should be.

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:48.882
It starts with little things...

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:51.593
and then big things.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.139
And nobody remembers anything different.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:04.898
There are multiple women dead
over multiple decades.

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.442
He's the one connecting them.

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:09.695
There'll be more.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.446
I don't know how,

00:01:12.281 --> 00:01:13.574
but he's been watching me

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:16.076
since I was a kid.

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:19.162
He's everybody.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:20.914
He's nobody.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.876
He's all the time.

00:01:25.878 --> 00:01:29.673
Why are you doing this?

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.636
Just because something hasn't happened,

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.513
doesn't mean it won't.

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:38.557
We're all connected.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.646
Things changed for me just like that.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:47.524
And then it happens again.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.525
And again.

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:49.526
And again.

00:01:53.197 --> 00:01:54.531
You shouldn't be here.

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.663
What's his name?

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.922
Who's the man who visits you?

